            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalokho isho kanje iNkosi uJehova, ithi: Kuphila kwami, impela isifungo sami asideleleyo, nesifungo sami asephulayo, ngiyakukubeka phezu kwekhanda lakhe.",
