        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi ngiyozendlala phezu kwakhe, futhi uyobanjwa enetheni lami, futhi ngiyomyisa eBabele futhi ngingene lapho ekulweni naye ngenxa yesiphambeko sakhe asenzele sona kimi.",
