        {
          "text": "Isho kanje iNkosi uJehova, ithi: Ngiyakuthatha futhi phezulu komsedari, ngiwubeke; Ngiyakunquma ethambile esiqongweni samagatsha aso, ngilitshale entabeni ende, enhle kakhulu;",
