        },
        {
          "text": "Entabeni ephakemeyo yakwa-Israyeli ngiyolitshala, lithele, lithele, libe ngumsedari omuhle; futhi ngaphansi kwawo kuyakuhlala zonke izinyoni zamaphiko onke; emthunzini wakhe bayohlala.",
